						"description":"Procedural brick wall material featuring evenly laid bricks with subtle size variation, realistic mortar lines, and natural surface roughness. Designed to replicate classic masonry walls with slight color variation and worn edges. Fully procedural\u2014no image textures\u2014allowing easy control over brick size, spacing, color, and roughness. Suitable for architectural visualization, urban environments, and game-ready scenes.",
